</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.380" end="00:49.710"><span begin="00:46.380" end="00:46.530">I </span><span begin="00:46.530" end="00:46.920">got </span><span begin="00:46.920" end="00:47.040">your </span><span begin="00:47.040" end="00:47.460">body </span><span begin="00:47.460" end="00:47.850">rockin' </span><span begin="00:47.850" end="00:48.150">side </span><span begin="00:48.150" end="00:48.270">to </span><span begin="00:48.270" end="00:48.990">side </span><span begin="00:48.990" end="00:48.990">（</span><span begin="00:48.990" end="00:49.440">Straight </span><span begin="00:49.440" end="00:49.680">up</span><span begin="00:49.680" end="00:49.690">!</span><span begin="00:49.690" end="00:49.710">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.710" end="00:53.010"><span begin="00:49.710" end="00:49.890">I </span><span begin="00:49.890" end="00:50.280">put </span><span begin="00:50.280" end="00:50.430">you </span><span begin="00:50.430" end="00:50.700">on </span><span begin="00:50.700" end="00:50.820">and </span><span begin="00:50.820" end="00:51.000">now </span><span begin="00:51.000" end="00:51.180">you're </span><span begin="00:51.180" end="00:51.600">feelin' </span><span begin="00:51.600" end="00:52.410">right </span><span begin="00:52.410" end="00:52.410">（</span><span begin="00:52.410" end="00:52.770">Straight </span><span begin="00:52.770" end="00:52.980">up</span><span begin="00:52.980" end="00:52.990">!</span><span begin="00:52.990" end="00:53.010">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.010" end="00:56.430"><span begin="00:53.010" end="00:53.160">I </span><span begin="00:53.160" end="00:53.550">know </span><span begin="00:53.550" end="00:54.120">exactly </span><span begin="00:54.120" end="00:54.450">what </span><span begin="00:54.450" end="00:54.510">is </span><span begin="00:54.510" end="00:54.600">is </span><span begin="00:54.600" end="00:54.810">on </span><span begin="00:54.810" end="00:54.930">your </span><span begin="00:54.930" end="00:55.830">mind <